Get an application's Klaviyo App Marketplace listing by ID, including its description, features, the scopes it requests, and install_url. Applications cannot be installed, verified as installed, or uninstalled through this server. To install one, give the user its install_url to open in their browser, where they approve the requested scopes on Klaviyo's OAuth consent screen.

```ts
